	// ⭐ **THE FOUR `__ManagedDirectory` STATICS — the surface BOTH references declare** (`2-Parser.cs:1459-1463`,
	// `LowerMaxonToStd.maxon:1913-1919`). A name outside it is REFUSED BY NAME here rather than left to fall
	// through, exactly as `parseManagedFileStaticCall` argues: falling through would mangle
	// `__ManagedDirectory.list` into a callee no file declares and surface as E3004 against a name the author
	// did write.
