	// it is tracked as an owned temporary whose drop is `__md_destruct` — the RAII close
	// (`SignatureIndex.managedNameDropCallee`). `currentPath` returns an owned `__ManagedMemory` (an `Array`
	// record), which is tracked the same way `__ManagedMemory.create`'s result is.
