	// ⚠ **OWNERSHIP: it produces an OWNED box.** It goes through `emitOwnedRuntimeResult`, so it is tracked as
	// an owned temporary whose drop is `__ms_destruct` — the RAII close (`SignatureIndex.managedNameDropCallee`).
	//
	// ⚠ Throwing-ness is NOT decided here — `isThrowingManagedSocketRuntimeCallee` names the callee and the
	// composed `isThrowingRuntimeCallee` is read by the parser's E3055 accept and SemanticCheck's E3057
	// reject, so a `try` is required at exactly the places those two agree on.
	function parseManagedSocketStaticCall(func IrFunction, typeTok Token) returns ValueId throws ParseError
