	// ⭐ **THE THREE `__ManagedSocket` INSTANCE METHODS — `sendFrom`, `recv`, `close`.** The cursor sits on the
	// method NAME (`dispatchMethodOnReceiver` consumed the `.`).
	//
	// ⚠ The buffer is BORROWED by all three, not consumed: `__ms_send_from` reads out of it and `__ms_recv`
